        "## 7. Selecting one value from a Series\n",
        "\n",
        "There are two important ways to select a value.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `.loc`\n",
        "\n",
        "`.loc` uses the **label**.\n",
        "\n",
        "If the index contains:\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Aarav, Diya, Kabir, Meera\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "then the label `\"Diya\"` can be used with `.loc`.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `.iloc`\n",
        "\n",
        "`.iloc` uses the **integer position**.\n",
        "\n",
        "The first position is `0`, the second is `1`, and so on.\n",
        "\n",
        "Remember:\n",
        "\n",
        "> `.loc` → label  \n",
        "> `.iloc` → integer position\n",
        "\n",
        "### Live coding\n",
        "\n",
        "Using `student_marks`:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Select Diya's marks using `.loc`.\n",
        "2. Select Diya's marks again using `.iloc`."
      ],
      "id": "JdUTSDBkjSxm"
    },
