        "```text\n",
        "True\n",
        "True\n",
        "False\n",
        "True\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Pandas can then use that Boolean result to select the required values.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Live coding\n",
        "\n",
        "Using `student_marks`:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Create a condition for marks greater than or equal to `85`.\n",
        "2. Use the condition to display the matching students."
