        "## 13. Series alignment\n",
        "\n",
        "One of the useful features of pandas is that labelled objects can be aligned using their index.\n",
        "\n",
        "Consider two Series:\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Quiz 1\n",
        "Aarav    18\n",
        "Diya     15\n",
        "Kabir    20\n",
        "\n",
        "Quiz 2\n",
        "Kabir    17\n",
        "Aarav    19\n",
        "Diya     16\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "The order is different.\n",
        "\n",
        "When the Series are added, pandas matches the students by their **labels**, not simply by their positions.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is called **index alignment**.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Live coding\n",
        "\n",
        "Create `quiz1` and `quiz2` with the values above.\n",
        "\n",
        "Then add them.\n",
